WEBVTT

00:02:58.435 --> 00:03:04.954
(Music)

00:03:04.978 --> 00:03:08.149
I'm Adam Grant, and this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:03:08.173 --> 00:03:10.022
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:03:10.046 --> 00:03:12.420
I study how to make work not suck.

00:03:12.724 --> 00:03:13.895
In this show,

00:03:13.919 --> 00:03:17.022
I'm inviting myself inside the minds
of some truly unusual people,

00:03:17.022 --> 00:03:20.138
because they mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:03:20.162 --> 00:03:22.826
Today, career staying power.

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:26.043
It's more about the choices you make
than the age you reach.

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:29.823
Thanks to Accenture
for sponsoring this episode.